    34	fleet recovery followed in [PR #5](https://github.com/HiQS-Labs/XYZ-CLIO/pull/5).
    35	
    36	## Search prompt history
    37	
    38	Use the verified helper path in place of the installed path below when necessary.
    39	Choose a bounded time range and start with 20 records. Convert the requested local
    40	window to timezone-qualified ISO timestamps; both date endpoints are inclusive.
    41	
    42	```bash
    43	python3 "$HOME/.claude/hooks/clio-store.py" query --text 'search phrase' --limit 20
    44	python3 "$HOME/.claude/hooks/clio-store.py" query --repo rebalanceOS \
    45	  --since 2026-10-01T00:00:00-07:00 --until 2026-10-02T23:59:59-07:00 --limit 20
    46	python3 "$HOME/.claude/hooks/clio-store.py" query --session SESSION --offset 20 --limit 20
    47	python3 "$HOME/.claude/hooks/clio-store.py" query --record-id clio1-RECORD_HASH
    48	python3 "$HOME/.claude/hooks/clio-store.py" --db /explicit/private/history.sqlite3 query --limit 20
    49	```
    50	
    51	Replace example dates/identifiers with the requested scope. Available filters:
    52	`--repo`, `--repo-slug`, `--device`, `--origin`, `--agent`, `--session`,
    53	`--record-id`, `--reference`, `--since`, `--until`, `--text`; `--explain` adds a query
    54	plan. Filters combine with AND. Repo/device/agent/session filters are exact;
    55	`--text` is a **literal, case-sensitive substring**, not full-text or semantic
    56	search. Try a shorter substring or known spelling if the first query is empty.
    57	`--reference` accepts a reference URL or `repo_slug:row_id` when recorded.
    58	
    59	Results are `records` ordered by timestamp then record ID, descending. Increase
    60	`--offset` by the page size while the page is full and the request needs more;
    61	limits must be 1–1000. Pin `--until` for a bounded investigation and deduplicate
    62	by `record_id`; concurrent historical imports can still shift offset pages.
    63	
    64	The helper opens an **existing** DB using `mode=rw` plus `PRAGMA query_only`.
    65	It cannot mutate event data or create a missing DB, but SQLite WAL/SHM bookkeeping
    66	may occur. Do not promise byte-for-byte filesystem immutability. Inspect returned
    67	`pending`, `fleet`, and `note_status` when present; absent fleet metadata is not
    68	proof of complete fleet coverage. A successful query only covers this replica.
    69	
