    12	This repo **is** an MCP server. Every refresh and query path is exposed through MCP tools — do not scan the codebase for `rebalance ...` CLI commands or write ad-hoc shell pipelines. Reach for the tools first.
    13	
    14	**CLIO history and HiQS activity lookup:** use the repository [CLIO skill](.agents/skills/clio/SKILL.md) for the configured SQLite reader and the `github_activity` authorship store, with optional Pulse/Daily summaries.
